# SSL certificate domain list, one per line. Comments (#) and blank lines
# are ignored. Each line is grouped by suffix-match into the matching
# entry in `domains` (group_vars/all.yml); the first non-wildcard entry
# under each domain becomes that domain's cert lineage primary.
#
# Wildcards (e.g. *.ops.uat.example.com) are supported because the SSL
# role uses DNS-01 challenge via Cloudflare API.
#
# Re-run the SSL playbook any time to add or remove entries; each
# domain's lineage is pinned with --cert-name <primary> so the run
# replaces the SAN list with whatever is in this file.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# UAT example (uncomment for the UAT VM):
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# uat.example.com
# *.uat.example.com
# *.ops.uat.example.com
#
# uat.example.org
# *.uat.example.org
# *.ops.uat.example.org
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Prod example (uncomment for the Prod VM):
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# example.com
# www.example.com
# *.example.com
# *.ops.example.com
#
# example.org
# www.example.org
# *.example.org
# *.ops.example.org
